-- Reviewed openings for the functor-of-points comparison (DESIGN.md).
-- Proof headers describe units/inverses, affine classification, canonical lifts,
-- affine evaluation, atlas gluing, probe separation, and the two inverse laws.
-- Space/map packaging and slice/Spec instance comparisons are by definition.
-- Natural families are in U (l+1); equations of geometric maps are in U l.
